                <div class="modal-body bg-white" style="padding: 20px;">
                    <div class="alert bg-light border py-2 px-3 mb-3 text-muted" style="font-size: 11px;"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i> El sistema calculará sobreestadías y lates automáticamente para el Booking: <strong id="finBookingTitle" class="text-dark"></strong><span id="finContainerLabelWrap" class="d-none"> — Contenedor <strong id="finContainerLabel" class="text-primary"></strong></span></div>

                    <div class="form-section p-3 mb-3">
